{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a bustling village known for its exquisite handcrafted dolls, Doll Town now rots in silence and shadows. Abandoned factories, empty schools, and forgotten shrines are all that remain\u2014haunted by memories of the students who perished here years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Yumi</strong>, a student who takes a part-time job at the town\u2019s only convenience store, unknowingly stepping into a nightmare that refuses to stay buried. As the line between reality and dream dissolves, Yumi must uncover the <strong>truth behind the deaths, the cursed dolls, and the macabre love story that destroyed the town.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Third-Person Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong>Navigate abandoned streets, schools, and factories where every corner hides secrets\u2014or threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/283e34ea62ceadc530195df0c191e68a.poster.avif?t=1760361710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/283e34ea62ceadc530195df0c191e68a.webm?t=1760361710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nightmarish blend of rural Japan\u2019s quiet beauty and suffocating dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/cc70850cf857ce052482e0ecfa58d239.poster.avif?t=1760361710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/cc70850cf857ce052482e0ecfa58d239.webm?t=1760361710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unravel the Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the fate of the students and the chilling love story at the town\u2019s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/7ba6a5f0f57215e85afda6e300ea5f8c.poster.avif?t=1760361710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/7ba6a5f0f57215e85afda6e300ea5f8c.webm?t=1760361710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tense Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a slow-burn descent into horror, where nothing is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/804fe2ae91e6b5c94007bb651e6e420a.poster.avif?t=1760361710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/804fe2ae91e6b5c94007bb651e6e420a.webm?t=1760361710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Ambience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horizontal cinematic scenes and environmental storytelling draw you deeper into the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204320/extras/2c865447374363034595b6d4e79c2bb7.poster.avif?t=1760361710\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"htt